>UK grid reference quick card
British National Grid: use the square letters, then read right and up.
Take the easting at the left edge and northing at the bottom. Add a tenth to each for a six-figure reference. Example: square SK 2345, three tenths right and six up, is SK 233 456. Say the format and give a landmark and uncertainty.

